Error [E0136]: making a `Severity` from a runtime value can fail
  --> tests/ui/range_type_runtime_needs_try.jet:5:30
    |
  5 |     sev :: Severity.from_int(raw)
    |                              ^^^
 Why: only a literal is checked at compile time; a runtime number needs the fallible form so a bad value is handled
 Fix: write `Severity.from_int(raw)?` and handle the failure
